P3 — Repeated continuation messages may notify managers too often

When a message matches an existing issue, notifyIssueUpdate() notifies managers and assigned staff.

For every minor continuation, this can become noisy.

Better rule:

Continuation of active issue → notify all members from owner, manager and the assigned staff memeber
Reopen resolved issue → notify assigned staff + managers
Urgent severity increase → notify managers
Unassigned issue → notify managers



